---
import BlogArticle from "../../components/BlogArticle.astro";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Óros SM: Navigating the AI Storm">
  <BlogArticle
    title="Óros SM: Navigating the AI Storm"
    subtitle="Why strategy is your only beacon in tomorrow's marketing"
    author="Óros Strategy and Marketing (OSM)"
    publishedAt="November 5, 2025"
    readingTime="4 min read"
    heroImage="/blog-ia.svg"
    tags={["AI", "Strategy", "Marketing"]}
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 text-gray-600">
      <p>
        The digital landscape is not just changing; <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">it is undergoing a seismic transformation</span> driven by Artificial Intelligence.
      </p>
      <p>
        There is a major truth that most agencies fail to mention: AI is a tool of immense potential to streamline processes, optimize ads, and target audiences like never before. However, it is also a threat: if your competitors adopt it before you do, your business becomes <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">instantly uncompetitive</span>. And the most challenging part is its <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">unpredictability</span>; no one knows which new tool or platform will dominate six months from now.
      </p>
      <p>
        Facing this whirlwind of change, <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">the only certainty is strategy.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">Óros Strategy and Marketing (OSM)</span>, founded by <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">Mauricio López</span> and <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">Miguel Murúa</span> in Córdoba, Argentina, was born to offer you precisely that certainty: a <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">controlled marketing process</span> where the constant evolution of AI is not an obstacle, but our primary engine.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-semibold text-[#001F3F]">Our Control Methodology in the Age of AI</h2>
      <p>
        Our philosophy is built around the <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">Ascent</span> and protecting your investment:
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#001F3F]">CIMA (Strategy – Navy Vision)</h3>
      <p>
        We take the lead in unpredictability. AI can predict short-term trends, but only a solid human strategy defines long-term <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">business purpose</span>. This is the unshakeable pillar that dictates how and where we apply emerging tools.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#001F3F]">LOMADA (Execution – Coral Action)</h3>
      <p>
        We integrate the latest AI tools into asset creation and campaign optimization. This allows us to execute at unprecedented speeds, generating a <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">higher volume of A/B testing</span> and an efficiency that guarantees an immediate competitive edge.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-[#001F3F]">ASCENSO (Performance – Continuous Adaptation)</h3>
      <p>
        Our team never stands still. We continuously monitor and refine the plan. By embracing the <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">volatile nature</span> of AI, your budget moves intelligently, pivoting from one platform or tool to another as soon as a more efficient option emerges. <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">You will never fall behind.</span>
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        At <span class="font-semibold text-[#303133]">Óros SM</span>, our promise isn't to predict the future, but to build a system strong enough to master it.
      </blockquote>
      <p>
        If you are ready to make AI work for your growth rather than against it, let's talk.
      </p>
    </div>
  </BlogArticle>
</Layout>

<style>
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  blockquote {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>